          "snippet": {
            "line": 468,
            "text": "theorem integral_rephase (d : CircleDensity) (f : ℝ → ℝ) (hf : Continuous f) :\n    (∫ φ in (0 : ℝ)..1, rephase d f φ) =\n      ∫ θ in (0 : ℝ)..(2 * Real.pi), f θ * d.rate θ"
